# =========================================
# 🔐 SECURITY - NEVER COMMIT THESE FILES
# =========================================

# Credentials and secrets
**/PRIVATE_CREDENTIALS/
**/*_LOGIN_SETUP*.md
**/*SECRET*.md
**/*PASSWORD*.md
**/*CREDENTIALS*.md
**/DEPLOYMENT_GUIDE.md
**/UPLOAD_FILES_GCP.md
**/ARQUITECTURA_VM.md
**/IMPLEMENTATION_SUMMARY.md
**/SECURITY_UPDATE_README.md
**/VM_MASTER_DOCUMENTATION.md

# Database files with passwords
**/setup_postgresql.sql
**/install.sh

# Environment files with secrets
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example

# SSH keys and certificates
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*.p12
**/*.jks
!**/google-services.json

# Logs that might contain sensitive data
**/logs/
**/*.log

# Temporary files that might contain secrets
**/*_backup_*.sql
**/*_dump_*.sql